cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "barec-2026-readability: equal-weight ensembling for sentence-level Arabic readability"
abstract: >-
  Code and public-split artifacts for team thylinao at the BAREC 2026 Shared Task on
  sentence-level Arabic readability assessment. A fourteen-member equal-weight ensemble of
  Arabic encoder fine-tunes, decoded to the 19-level BAREC scale by 18 tuned cutpoints. 85.3
  QWK, first place on both sentence-level tracks in the official results.
authors:
